{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "bds_terrain_changed",
  "spec": ["building-development 4.11"],
  "description": "DoTerrainChanged for kinds 1-3, the float32 values computed with numpy (cell width 16: r24(1/16) = 0.0625; terrain altitude 100 everywhere). Lot 1: centre y 99 -> d = 1, both slopes 1 -> A - B = 0 -> UpdateLotElements. Lot 2: y 103 -> d = -3 < -1, demolishable -> queued. Lot 3: y 97.9 -> d = r24(100 - 97.9f) = 2.0999985 > 2, not demolishable -> dezoned at once (PlaceZone zone 0 over its rectangle, flag = kind in {1, 2}). Lot 4: y 98 -> d = 2 (inside), developer slope 1.3998188 (0x3FB32D43) -> A = 0.087266475 > 0.08726647 (0x3DB2B8C3), lot slope 0 -> too steep, demolishable -> queued. Lot 5: y 101 -> d = -1 (inside), developer slope 0, lot slope 1.3998188: A - B < 0 -> passes (only A - B is compared, no absolute value). Lot 6: developer slope 1.3998187 (0x3FB32D42) -> A = 0.08726647 exactly -> passes. Then DemolishLots(queued = [2, 4]) with cost 500: kind 1 -> funds 100000 - 500 = 99500; kind 2 -> 99000; kind 3 -> no funds change (and the dezone flag is false). DemolishLots is called even with an empty queue; cost 0 changes nothing. Kind 0, 4, 256 or 257 -> UpdateLotElements for every lot, no checks, no DemolishLots. UpdateLotElements takes a bool hadFoundation (lot-developer.md slot 37) while §4.11 passes kind: the event's had_foundation is the low byte of kind != 0 [inferred], so 256 gives false and 257 true. An empty rectangle does nothing. Lots outside the rectangle are not visited.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "bds_process", "seed": 1},
    {"op": "bds_world", "altitude": 100, "funds": 100000, "demolish_cost": 500},
    {"op": "bds_create"},
    {"op": "bds_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "bds_lots", "lots": [
      {"id": 1, "rect": [0, 0, 1, 1], "center": [16, 99, 16], "dev_slope": 1, "slope": 1, "demolishable": true},
      {"id": 2, "rect": [2, 0, 3, 1], "center": [48, 103, 16], "demolishable": true},
      {"id": 3, "rect": [4, 0, 5, 1], "center": [80, 97.9, 16], "demolishable": false},
      {"id": 4, "rect": [6, 0, 7, 1], "center": [112, 98, 16], "dev_slope": 1.399818778038025, "slope": 0, "demolishable": true},
      {"id": 5, "rect": [8, 0, 9, 1], "center": [144, 101, 16], "dev_slope": 0, "slope": 1.399818778038025, "demolishable": true},
      {"id": 6, "rect": [10, 0, 11, 1], "center": [176, 100, 16], "dev_slope": 1.3998186588287354, "slope": 0, "demolishable": false},
      {"id": 7, "rect": [30, 30, 31, 31], "center": [496, 0, 496], "demolishable": true}]},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[0, 0, 11, 1], 1]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 1, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "dezone", "rect": [4, 0, 5, 1], "flag": true},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 5, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 6, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "demolish_lots", "lots": [2, 4], "cost": 500},
      {"event": "set_funds", "value": 99500}]},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"funds": 99500}},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[0, 0, 11, 1], 2]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "dezone"}, "events": [{"rect": [4, 0, 5, 1], "flag": true}]},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"funds": 99000}},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[0, 0, 11, 1], 3]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 1, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "dezone", "rect": [4, 0, 5, 1], "flag": false},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 5, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 6, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "demolish_lots", "lots": [2, 4], "cost": 500}]},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"funds": 99000}},

    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[0, 0, 1, 1], 1]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 1, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "demolish_lots", "lots": [], "cost": 500},
      {"event": "set_funds", "value": 98500}]},
    {"op": "bds_world", "demolish_cost": 0},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[2, 0, 3, 1], 2]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "demolish_lots", "lots": [2], "cost": 0}]},
    {"op": "bds_expect", "state": {"funds": 98500}},

    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[0, 0, 5, 1], 0]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[2, 0, 3, 1], 4]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[2, 0, 3, 1], 256]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[2, 0, 3, 1], 257]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 1, "had_foundation": false},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 2, "had_foundation": false},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 3, "had_foundation": false},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 2, "had_foundation": true},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 2, "had_foundation": false},
      {"event": "update_lot_elements", "lot": 2, "had_foundation": true}]},
    {"op": "bds_clear_events"},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[5, 0, 4, 1], 1]},
    {"op": "bds_call", "method": "terrain_changed", "args": [[0, 2, 11, 1], 1]},
    {"op": "bds_expect_events", "events": []}
  ]
}
